{"id":"wb-5-38","name":"龙虬庄遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"龙虬庄遗址","text":"龙虬庄遗址位于中国江苏省高邮市龙虬镇龙虬庄村，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n龙虬庄遗址于20世纪70年代被发现，1993～1995年进行了四次考古发掘，清理出墓葬402座，房屋遗址1处，可确认为新石器时代遗址，距今约5000～7000年，属于一分布于大运河以东江淮地区的古文化类型。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BE%99%E8%99%AC%E5%BA%84%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":89656436,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89656436","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c383ef0033454ed34f5910f9.jpg","title":"龙虬庄遗址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%BE%99%E8%99%AC%E5%BA%84%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/%E9%BE%99%E8%99%AC%E5%BA%84%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Howhowforever","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​龙虬庄遗址","width":320,"height":427}}